cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper listed below."
title: "Four Lessons from Building a Licence-Based Reviewer for PLC Change Orders"
abstract: >-
  Artifact for a study that compiles PLC change orders into executable licences
  and decides whether a proposed patch stays inside them, with a 96-program
  corpus, a 522-case verdict matrix and an 18-configuration comparison.
